{"name":"Frostbite, Undead White Dragonling","size":"medium","type":"Dragon","tag":"","alignment":"chaotic evil","hitDice":"10","armorName":"natural armor","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":5,"otherArmorDesc":"16 (natural armor)","speed":"30","burrowSpeed":"10","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"60","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":true,"customSpeed":false,"hpText":"68 (8d8 + 32)","speedDesc":"30 ft., burrow 15 ft., fly 60 ft.","strPoints":"18","dexPoints":"10","conPoints":"18","intPoints":"6","wisPoints":"11","chaPoints":"12","blindsight":"10","blind":false,"darkvision":"60","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"4","customCr":"4 (1,100 XP)","customProf":2,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"The young white dragon can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The young white dragon regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the young white dragon can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the young white dragon can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The young white dragon can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the young white dragon's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the young white dragon's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the young white dragon dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Ice Walk","desc":"The dragon can move across and climb icy surfaces without needing to make an ability check. Additionally, difficult terrain composed of ice or snow doesn't cost it extra movement."},{"name":"Undead Nature","desc":"The dragonling does not require air, food, drink, or sleep."},{"name":"Chilling Presence","desc":"A non‑undead creature that starts its turn within 10 feet of the dragonling takes 2 (1d4) cold damage if the dragonling is not incapacitated."}],"actions":[{"name":"Multiattack","desc":"The dragonling makes two attacks: one with its Bite and one with its Claws."},{"name":"Bite","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack:_ +6 to hit, reach 10 ft., one target. _Hit:_ 15 (2d10 + 4) piercing damage plus 4 (1d8) cold damage."},{"name":"Claw","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack:_ +6 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. _Hit:_ 11 (2d6 + 4) slashing damage."},{"name":"Cold Breath (Recharge 5-6)","desc":"The dragon exhales an icy blast in a 30-foot cone. Each creature in that area must make a DC 14 Constitution saving throw, taking 27 (6d8) cold damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one."},{"name":"Gravefrost Breath (Recharge 5-6)","desc":"The dragonling exhales necrotic ice in a 30‑foot cone. Each creature in that area must make a DC 13 Constitution saving throw, taking 22 (5d8) cold and necrotic damage (you choose the mix) on a failed save, or half as much on a success. A creature reduced to 0 hit points by this damage is frozen solid; it is stable but unconscious, and its body is encased in ice until an adjacent creature spends an action and succeeds on a DC 14 Strength (Athletics) check to break it free (or until it takes fire damage)."}],"bonusActions":[],"reactions":[],"legendaries":[],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[{"name":"dex","order":1},{"name":"con","order":2},{"name":"wis","order":4},{"name":"cha","order":5}],"skills":[{"name":"perception","stat":"wis"},{"name":"stealth","stat":"dex"}],"damagetypes":[{"name":"cold","note":" (Immune)","type":"i"}],"specialdamage":[],"conditions":[{"name":"charmed"},{"name":"exhaustion"},{"name":"frightened"},{"name":"poisoned"}],"languages":[{"name":"Draconic","speaks":false}],"understandsBut":"","shortName":"","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":true,"separationPoint":2,"damage":[]}